- content_for :title, "CE & UKCA Certification - About Baldrick"
- content_for :og_image, asset_url('ce-ukca-rohs.png')

.max-w-6xl.mx-auto.px-4.sm:px-6.lg:px-8.py-8
  / Breadcrumb
  = render 'shared/breadcrumbs', breadcrumbs: [{ title: 'Home', path: '/' }, { title: 'Baldrick Breakthroughs', path: '/breakthroughs' }, { title: 'CE & UKCA Certification', path: nil }]

  / Main Content Card
  .bg-white.rounded-lg.shadow-lg.overflow-hidden
    / Header Section
    = render 'shared/page_header', title: 'CE & UKCA Certification', subtitle: 'Quality that goes beyond the basics - certified safe and compliant', image_url: 'ce-ukca-rohs.png'

    / Content Section
    .px-8.py-8
      .max-w-4xl.mx-auto
        .prose.max-w-none
          h2.text-3xl.font-bold.text-gray-900.mb-6 CE & UKCA Certification

          p.text-lg.text-gray-700.mb-6
            | These days it's easy enough to slap an ESP32 on a board, add a few pixel outputs, preload WLED and call it a controller. From the start though, we wanted to go further.

          p.text-lg.text-gray-700.mb-6
            | The 
            = link_to "Baldrick8", board_path('baldrick8'), class: "text-indigo-600 hover:text-indigo-800 font-medium"
            |  was built to be the best-in-class budget board – but "budget" never meant cutting corners. Every component we use is fully RoHS compliant, and we've put our boards through independent lab testing to achieve CE and UKCA certification. It's not cheap, but we believe it's worth it. Certification proves that we don't just stand behind the Baldrick line of controllers – we stand above the crowd.

          p.text-lg.text-gray-700.mb-6
            | All Baldrick products meet the highest safety and compliance standards, ensuring they can be safely used in both European and UK markets.

          .text-center.mb-8
            = image_tag "ce-ukca-rohs.png", alt: "CE, UKCA, and RoHS Certification Logos", class: "max-w-full sm:max-w-md mx-auto w-full h-auto"

          h3.text-2xl.font-bold.text-gray-900.mb-4 What is CE Certification?

          p.text-gray-700.mb-6
            | CE (Conformité Européenne) marking indicates that a product meets the safety, health, and environmental requirements of the European Economic Area. It's a mandatory requirement for products sold in the EU.

          h3.text-2xl.font-bold.text-gray-900.mb-4 What is UKCA Certification?

          p.text-gray-700.mb-6
            | UKCA (UK Conformity Assessed) marking is the UK's equivalent to CE marking, required for products sold in Great Britain. It ensures products meet UK safety standards.

          h3.text-2xl.font-bold.text-gray-900.mb-4 What is RoHS?

          p.text-gray-700.mb-6
            | RoHS (Restriction of Hazardous Substances) is a directive that restricts the use of specific hazardous materials in electrical and electronic equipment. It ensures products are free from substances like lead, mercury, cadmium, and other harmful chemicals, making them safer for both users and the environment.

          h3.text-2xl.font-bold.text-gray-900.mb-4 Certification Documents

          p.text-gray-700.mb-6
            | Our Baldrick Board Family has been independently tested and certified. The certificates below cover the full product range, including Baldrick8, Baldrick17, BaldrickSwitchy, BaldrickDMX, BaldrickSignals, BaldrickInput8, BaldrickInput1, Baldrick2, BaldrickCue, and BaldrickScene.

          .grid.md:grid-cols-3.gap-6.mb-8
            .bg-blue-50.rounded-lg.p-6.border.border-blue-200
              h4.text-lg.font-semibold.text-gray-900.mb-3 CE Marking
              ul.space-y-3
                li
                  = link_to '/certificates/ce-lvd-certificate.pdf', class: 'text-indigo-600 hover:text-indigo-800 font-medium', target: '_blank', rel: 'noopener' do
                    | LVD Certificate
                    span.text-sm.text-gray-500.block BS EN IEC 62368-1
                li
                  = link_to '/certificates/ce-emc-certificate.pdf', class: 'text-indigo-600 hover:text-indigo-800 font-medium', target: '_blank', rel: 'noopener' do
                    | EMC Certificate
                    span.text-sm.text-gray-500.block EN 55032 / EN 55035
                li
                  = link_to '/certificates/eu-rohs-certificate.pdf', class: 'text-indigo-600 hover:text-indigo-800 font-medium', target: '_blank', rel: 'noopener' do
                    | EU RoHS Certificate

            .bg-red-50.rounded-lg.p-6.border.border-red-200
              h4.text-lg.font-semibold.text-gray-900.mb-3 UKCA Marking
              ul.space-y-3
                li
                  = link_to '/certificates/ukca-lvd-certificate.pdf', class: 'text-indigo-600 hover:text-indigo-800 font-medium', target: '_blank', rel: 'noopener' do
                    | LVD Certificate
                    span.text-sm.text-gray-500.block BS EN IEC 62368-1
                li
                  = link_to '/certificates/ukca-emc-certificate.pdf', class: 'text-indigo-600 hover:text-indigo-800 font-medium', target: '_blank', rel: 'noopener' do
                    | EMC Certificate
                    span.text-sm.text-gray-500.block EN 55032 / EN 55035
                li
                  = link_to '/certificates/uk-rohs-certificate.pdf', class: 'text-indigo-600 hover:text-indigo-800 font-medium', target: '_blank', rel: 'noopener' do
                    | UK RoHS Certificate

            .bg-gray-50.rounded-lg.p-6.border.border-gray-200
              h4.text-lg.font-semibold.text-gray-900.mb-3 Test Reports
              p.text-sm.text-gray-600.mb-3 Full laboratory test reports for technical compliance review.
              ul.space-y-3.text-sm
                li = link_to 'CE safety report', '/certificates/reports/ce-en-62368-safety-report.pdf', class: 'text-indigo-600 hover:text-indigo-800', target: '_blank', rel: 'noopener'
                li = link_to 'UK safety report', '/certificates/reports/uk-bs-en-62368-safety-report.pdf', class: 'text-indigo-600 hover:text-indigo-800', target: '_blank', rel: 'noopener'
                li = link_to 'CE EMC report', '/certificates/reports/ce-emc-test-report.pdf', class: 'text-indigo-600 hover:text-indigo-800', target: '_blank', rel: 'noopener'
                li = link_to 'UKCA EMC report', '/certificates/reports/ukca-emc-test-report.pdf', class: 'text-indigo-600 hover:text-indigo-800', target: '_blank', rel: 'noopener'
                li = link_to 'EU RoHS report', '/certificates/reports/eu-rohs-test-report.pdf', class: 'text-indigo-600 hover:text-indigo-800', target: '_blank', rel: 'noopener'
                li = link_to 'UK RoHS report', '/certificates/reports/uk-rohs-test-report.pdf', class: 'text-indigo-600 hover:text-indigo-800', target: '_blank', rel: 'noopener'

          .mt-8.bg-gray-50.rounded-lg.p-6.border.border-gray-200
            h4.text-lg.font-semibold.text-gray-900.mb-3 Need Something Else?
            p.text-gray-700.mb-4
              | If you need additional compliance documentation or have questions about certification for a specific product, our support team can help.
            = link_to 'Contact Support', '/support#hardware-support', class: 'inline-block bg-blue-600 text-white px-6 py-3 rounded-md hover:bg-blue-700 transition-colors'